<title>INDONESIA: Multidana Q1 net up to 35.0 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Multidana Q1 net up to 35.0 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  35.0    vs  6.1</p>
<p>    Revenue				    121.9    vs  35.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			    50.0    vs   8.7</p>
<p>    Total asset			    1,816.5    vs  588.7</p>
<p>Note: PT Putra Surya Multidana is one of Indonesia's largest consumer finance companies. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
